      "type": "text",
      "id": "legT",
      "x": 25,
      "y": 1003,
      "width": 1210.1534423828125,
      "height": 165,
      "text": "1   You pick a mode and an AI model, give a story (typed, ClickUp, Azure DevOps or a .md file), click Generate\n2   The server wraps the story in expert QA instructions and asks the AI for structured JSON\n3   It sends the request to the AI provider you picked, using that provider's API key from .env\n4   The AI answers with test cases, a checklist or one bug report, plus how many tokens it used\n5   The server sends the result back to your browser\n6   You review it (in a checklist, mark each check Pass or Fail) and export it: JSON, Markdown, CSV or PDF",
      "originalText": "1   You pick a mode and an AI model, give a story (typed, ClickUp, Azure DevOps or a .md file), click Generate\n2   The server wraps the story in expert QA instructions and asks the AI for structured JSON\n3   It sends the request to the AI provider you picked, using that provider's API key from .env\n4   The AI answers with test cases, a checklist or one bug report, plus how many tokens it used\n5   The server sends the result back to your browser\n6   You review it (in a checklist, mark each check Pass or Fail) and export it: JSON, Markdown, CSV or PDF",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
